Package: xfce-alt-scroll
Version: 0.1.0-1
Section: x11
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Maintainer: Local experimental build <root@localhost>
Depends: libc6 (>= 2.34), libx11-6, libxtst6, xinput
Description: XFCE Alt + touchpad scroll desktop zoom filter (experimental)
 Native X11 C utility to preserve smooth scrolling unless Alt is held,
 then generate step-based desktop zoom instead of scrolling applications.
 Supports multitouch touchpads; physical mouse wheels not yet supported.
